<title>HONG KONG: Rugby Union-Ireland beaten in World Cup sevens.</title>
<headline>Rugby Union-Ireland beaten in World Cup sevens.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of round robin pool matches on first day of World Cup Sevens rugby union tournament on Friday (Note: Teams will be ranked from 1-24 after completion of first round and re-drawn into pools for second day)</p>
<p>Pool G South Africa 45 Argentina 7 Argentina 31 Ireland 22</p>
</text>
